  "review": [
    "Constructor copies the complete fixed-record witness and normalized packet, hashes owned bytes, retains the exact CatalogOwner, and checks actual graph/catalog/snapshot spans and generation pins. Graph and SnapshotOwner remain immutable caller leases. Full packet comparison succeeds before output publication; failed allocations, digest, ownership or grammar retire provisional storage and preserve output/report.",
    "Initial scope is full NEW_WORLD with every normal file and all root slots. Original saved omission is rederived for every allocated definition, including inactive deletion records and file0 U16 file_idx65535. IDs, active modification times, file checksums, root activity and all record counts/order match retained source. Every eligible row must appear exactly once; omitted rows must be source-ineligible. Existing conservative comparator is unchanged.",
    "Comparison checks immutable packet identity, prefix/map file, full structure/footer CRCs, exact definition wire bytes and root name/packed matrices. It performs no allocations and commits only its report. Known public controls and source spans are disjoint; opaque owner/context allocation validity remains an explicit caller contract.",
    "Reviewer requested explicit accounting for SnapshotOwner metadata/index/slack beyond the automatically charged raw snapshot payload; final header and contract now require those hidden dependencies in caller retained_bytes. Constructor also now refuses selected DBID above INT32_MAX, with a dedicated control. No claim of complete hidden-owner accounting is inferred from raw span size.",
    "All309 final native/helper/header/source inputs match committed blobs and current files. Four unchanged original world-producer fixture profiles cover normal, saved omission, force reload and modified-on-disk override. Final7584 controls per release/ASan/UBSan verified from source-bound receipt; original producer libraries remain unsanitized. No corpus rerun by reviewer.",
    "The witness is diagnostic compatibility evidence. Session/map/selection/hash labels require external authenticated capture provenance at the SAME source boundary; hashes and caller labels do not establish it. CLIENT import of omitted saved definitions, active material/LOD resources and authoritative actor transaction remain missing. No live generation or world/ACK permission is produced."
  ],
